[
M_i
\neq
\operatorname{Thought}_i.
]

## 2. Manifest presence is not identical with the waking world model

[
M_i
\neq
W_i^{\mathrm{waking}}.
]

## 3. The ordinary self-boundary is plastic

[
\partial S_i
]

can change while the field persists.

